{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん今日も1日お疲れ様です!＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝､急ぎすぎてコート＆マフラーを身に付けずに\n家を飛び出してしまったひなです(*_*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒いよぉー\n周りのみんなは､とっても暖かそうな格好なのに､\nひな1人だけ薄着で､ブルブルしてます(>_<)\n誰かぁー助けてー(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..............\nっでも､もうすぐお家だから頑張れひな!!っと自分に言い聞かせる次第です(..)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひな頑張ります!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではではみなさんからのコメントにお答えしまーす*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな食べ物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.とろろ昆布と\n梅干しのお菓子です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.学校は給食？お弁当？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.お弁当と給食のどちらでも良いんですが､\nひなは､今日はお弁当を食べました!\nお母さんの手作りで､美味しかった＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.防寒対策は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.今日は忘れちゃったけど\nマフラーとあったかいお茶#"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.みかんさんは自画像？自分で描いたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.自分で描きました(^-^)/\n自画像のつもりじゃなかったけど､\nよーく見ると､髪の毛の量がひなみたいに多い!!(w)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.妹になってくれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.もちろん!!ひなのお兄ちゃん､お姉ちゃんになって\n妹のように、可愛がってほしいな＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.クリスマスは何が欲しい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.オレンジのペンとアクセサリー*(←欲張り？許してー#)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.初めて会ったときの印象とのギャップが大きいのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あしゅりん!!\n初めは､大人っぽくて､静かな子だなぁと思ったけど...\n本当は､キャッキャキャッキャしてて､甘えん坊さん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も､あしゅりんから「ひなちまー＊」ってメールが来て\n可愛いなぁもう!!っと思いました(^-^;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上でおーわり(^o^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが大好き＊*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま"}],"source":"archive"}